            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "chele"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Really enjoyed this salad. Great flavor and texture. Perfect light salad for summer. I used Feta instead of blue cheese and I might add a litte red onion next time around. But all in all really liked this and would make it again!",
            "datePublished": "2012-07-07T17:44:32.603Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
