              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Friendlyteacher"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this salad to be delicious! The only thing I did differently after tasting the dressing was to make a double portion, put it in a pretty jar, and allow people to add it to their own greens, knowing that it would be too bold for some. It also kept greens crisper. We paired with a savory chicken dish.",
            "datePublished": "2018-12-26T00:11:07.390Z"
